INSERT INTO DDMFIELDATTRIBUTE VALUES(0,0,615,16796623585306,610,35368,NULL,'en_US','','<p>I want to buy 2 different glasses.&nbsp;</p>\u000a\u000a<p>&nbsp;</p>\u000a\u000a<p>Product is important to products.</p>')
INSERT INTO DDMFIELDATTRIBUTE VALUES(0,0,616,16796623585306,611,35387,'availableLanguageIds',NULL,'','en_US')
INSERT INTO DDMFIELDATTRIBUTE VALUES(0,0,617,16796623585306,611,35387,'defaultLanguageId',NULL,'','en_US')
INSERT INTO DDMFIELDATTRIBUTE VALUES(0,0,618,16796623585306,612,35387,NULL,'en_US','<p>Glasses are a practical and stylish accessory that serve a dual purpose of correcting vision and enhancing one''s overall look. With a wide range of frames, styles, and lens options available, glasses have become more than just a vision aid; they are a fashionable statement piece that can complement any outfit.</p>\u000a\u000a<p>One of the key benefits of glasses is their ability to improve visual acuity for those with refractive errors such as nearsightedness, farsightedness, and astigmatism. By wearing glasses with the correct prescription, individuals can enjoy clearer, sharper vision for activities such as reading, driving, and watching TV.</p>\u000a\u000a<p>Moreover, glasses offer protection from harmful UV rays and blue light emitted from digital screens, reducing eye strain and potential long-term damage. They also come in a variety of materials, including lightweight and durable options like titanium and memory metals, ensuring comfort and longevity.</p>\u000a\u000a<p>Whether you prefer a classic wireframe, a trendy oversized style, or a sleek and modern design, glasses offer something for everyone, making them a versatile and essential accessory for everyday life.</p>\u000a\u000a<p>I want to buy 2 different glasses.&nbsp;</p>\u000a\u000a<p>&nbsp;</p>\u000a\u000a<p>Product is important to products.</p>',NULL)
INSERT INTO DDMFIELDATTRIBUTE VALUES(0,0,619,16796623585306,613,35395,'availableLanguageIds',NULL,'','en_US')
INSERT INTO DDMFIELDATTRIBUTE VALUES(0,0,620,16796623585306,613,35395,'defaultLanguageId',NULL,'','en_US')
INSERT INTO DDMFIELDATTRIBUTE VALUES(0,0,621,16796623585306,614,35395,NULL,'en_US','<p>Hey there! So, bootcamps are basically like a crash course in learning something new. It''s like getting a turbo boost for your skills in a short amount of time. Whether it''s coding, fitness, or even cooking, bootcamps are all about diving in headfirst and soaking up as much knowledge as you can. Sure, they can be intense, but hey, no pain, no gain, right? Plus, it''s a great way to meet new people, challenge yourself, and come out the other side feeling like a boss. So, ready to lace up those metaphorical boots and kick some butt at a bootcamp? Let''s do this! \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udd25</p>',NULL)
