\">\n    At Clarity, our commitment to making a difference goes beyond stylish eyewear. \n    Through initiatives like empowering underserved communities with access to quality \n    eyewear, we bridge vision gaps and contribute to socail well-being. \n    Simultaneously, our dedication to sustainability is reflected in our eco-friendly\t\n    practices, from responsible material sourcing to the use of recyclable packaging.\n    Every purchase you make with us not only enhances your style but also supports our\n    collective journey toward a brighter, more includsive, and susainable future. \n</p>\n"}}}}],"fragmentStyle":{"paddingBottom":"3","paddingLeft":"4","paddingTop":"4","textColor":"bodyBgColor"},"indexed":true},"id":"197263e6-798a-133d-274f-b5f2d31d9904","type":"Fragment"},{"definition":{"fragment":{"key":"BASIC_COMPONENT-button"},"fragmentConfig":{"buttonType":"primary","type":"link","buttonSize":"nm"},"fragmentFields":[{"id":"link","value":{"fragmentLink":{},"text":{"value_i18n":{"en_US":"Learn More About Our Impact"}}}}],"fragmentStyle":{"paddingBottom":"4","paddingLeft":"4"},"indexed":true},"id":"0b94d1c2-03f4-1536-2157-aa03b09b1a68","type":"Fragment"}],"type":"Column"},{"definition":{"columnViewports":[{"columnViewportDefinition":{"size":12},"id":"landscapeMobile"},{"columnViewportDefinition":{},"id":"portraitMobile"},{"columnViewportDefinition":{},"id":"tablet"}],"size":6},"id":"166ed143-a7a7-5715-8bd0-965d37cd1f82","pageElements":[{"definition":{"fragmentStyle":{"borderRadius":"15px","marginBottom":"4","marginRight":"4","marginTop":"4","overflow":"hidden","textAlign":"right"},"indexed":true,"layout":{"marginBottom":2,"marginRight":2,"marginTop":2},"name":"Image Container"},"id":"05a65c7f-ac8d-eca1-e2d8-34e8734c27e4","pageElements":[{"definition":{"fragment":{"key":"BASIC_COMPONENT-image"},"fragmentConfig":{"imageSize":"w-0"},"fragmentFields":[{"id":"image-square","value":{"fragmentImage":{"description":{"value_i18n":{"en_US":""}},"url":{"value_i18n":{