INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'e02ebb3d-698c-9b59-e3b3-d653be93ec2f','e02ebb3d-698c-9b59-e3b3-d653be93ec2f',38087,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:11:20.531000','2024-05-04 22:27:17.854000','The Importance of Eyewear in Digital Activities','Why You Need Special Glasses for Your Digital Life','the-importance-of-eyewear-in-digital-activities',NULL,'<p>In today\u2019s digital age, we spend a significant portion of our day\u000a  staring at screens. Whether you''re working on a computer, checking\u000a  messages on your smartphone, or playing video games, digital screen\u000a  exposure can cause eyestrain, dryness, and blurred vision. That''s\u000a  where digital eyewear comes in. These glasses are specially designed\u000a  to block harmful blue light emitted by digital screens, helping to\u000a  prevent digital eye strain and protect your vision. Furthermore, they\u000a  can even improve your sleep by reducing exposure to blue light in the\u000a  hours before bedtime. In this blog article, we''ll explore the benefits\u000a  of digital eyewear and help you choose the right pair for your lifestyle.</p>\u000a              <p>In today\u2019s digital age, we spend a significant portion\u000a  of   our   day   staring at screens. Whether you''re working on a\u000a  computer,   checking   messages on your smartphone, or playing video\u000a  games,   digital screen   exposure can cause eyestrain, dryness, and\u000a  blurred   vision. That''s   where digital eyewear comes in. These\u000a  glasses are   specially designed   to block harmful blue light emitted\u000a  by digital   screens, helping to   prevent digital eye strain and\u000a  protect your   vision. Furthermore, they   can even improve your sleep\u000a  by reducing   exposure to blue light in the   hours before bedtime. In\u000a  this blog   article, we''ll explore the benefits   of digital eyewear\u000a  and help you   choose the right pair for your lifestyle.</p>\u000a              <p>In today\u2019s digital age, we spend a significant portion\u000a  of   our   day   staring at screens. Whether you''re working on a\u000a  computer,   checking   messages on your smartphone, or playing video\u000a  games,   digital screen   exposure can cause eyestrain, dryness, and\u000a  blurred   vision. That''s   where digital eyewear comes in. These\u000a  glasses are   specially designed   to block harmful blue light emitted\u000a  by digital   screens, helping to   prevent digital eye strain and\u000a  protect your   vision. Furthermore, they   can even improve your sleep\u000a  by reducing   exposure to blue light in the   hours before bedtime. In\u000a  this blog   article, we''ll explore the benefits   of digital eyewear\u000a  and help you   choose the right pair for your lifestyle.</p>','2024-05-01 14:11:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38081,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-04 22:27:17.854000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'31f0a63d-2561-281d-0e72-2328308677cb','31f0a63d-2561-281d-0e72-2328308677cb',38118,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:12:48.377000','2024-05-04 22:23:52.118000','Stars and Specs: Celebrity Eyewear Trends','The Latest Celebrity Eyewear Trends to Try Now','stars-and-specs-celebrity-eyewear-trends',NULL,'<p>Celebrities have a knack for setting trends, and eyewear is no\u000a  exception. From Kendall Jenner''s sleek aviators to Elton John''s\u000a  flamboyant frames, there''s a celebrity eyewear inspiration for every\u000a  style and taste. And it''s not just about sunglasses: prescription\u000a  glasses are getting a moment in the spotlight, too. Celebrities like\u000a  Ryan Gosling, Jennifer Aniston, and Zoe Kravitz have all been seen\u000a  rocking stylish specs, proving that glasses can be just as fashionable\u000a  as any other accessory. So, whether you''re a fan of the classic\u000a  cat-eye or prefer something more modern, there''s a celebrity-inspired\u000a  style out there for you. All you need is a little inspiration to find\u000a  your perfect pair.</p>\u000a              <p>Celebrities have a knack for setting trends, and\u000a  eyewear   is   no   exception. From Kendall Jenner''s sleek aviators to\u000a  Elton   John''s   flamboyant frames, there''s a celebrity eyewear\u000a  inspiration   for every   style and taste. And it''s not just about\u000a  sunglasses:   prescription   glasses are getting a moment in the\u000a  spotlight, too.   Celebrities like   Ryan Gosling, Jennifer Aniston,\u000a  and Zoe Kravitz   have all been seen   rocking stylish specs, proving\u000a  that glasses can   be just as fashionable   as any other accessory.\u000a  So, whether you''re a   fan of the classic   cat-eye or prefer\u000a  something more modern, there''s   a celebrity-inspired   style out\u000a  there for you. All you need is a   little inspiration to find   your\u000a  perfect pair.</p>\u000a              <p>Celebrities have a knack for setting trends, and\u000a  eyewear   is   no   exception. From Kendall Jenner''s sleek aviators to\u000a  Elton   John''s   flamboyant frames, there''s a celebrity eyewear\u000a  inspiration   for every   style and taste. And it''s not just about\u000a  sunglasses:   prescription   glasses are getting a moment in the\u000a  spotlight, too.   Celebrities like   Ryan Gosling, Jennifer Aniston,\u000a  and Zoe Kravitz   have all been seen   rocking stylish specs, proving\u000a  that glasses can   be just as fashionable   as any other accessory.\u000a  So, whether you''re a   fan of the classic   cat-eye or prefer\u000a  something more modern, there''s   a celebrity-inspired   style out\u000a  there for you. All you need is a   little inspiration to find   your\u000a  perfect pair.</p>','2024-05-01 14:12:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38112,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-04 22:23:52.118000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'1a2642b4-4d6e-3689-b1ff-09c698ac9b30','1a2642b4-4d6e-3689-b1ff-09c698ac9b30',38131,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:13:00.844000','2024-05-04 22:12:58.643000','Embrace Your Inner Star with Celebrity-Inspired Eyewear','Get the A-List Look with These Celebrity Eyewear Inspirations','embrace-your-inner-star-with-celebrity-inspired-eyewear',NULL,'<p>Celebrities are often at the forefront of fashion, and eyewear is no\u000a  exception. From the red carpet to the street, stars are constantly\u000a  showing us how to make a statement with a pair of glasses or\u000a  sunglasses. Whether it''s Gigi Hadid''s trendy oversized frames or\u000a  Johnny Depp''s quirky round glasses, there''s a celebrity eyewear\u000a  inspiration for everyone. What''s more, these trends aren''t just for\u000a  the rich and famous. With so many affordable and stylish options\u000a  available, anyone can embrace their inner star and try out these\u000a  looks. So, if you''re in the market for a new pair of glasses, why not\u000a  take a cue from your favorite celebrities? You might just find your\u000a  new favorite accessory.</p>\u000a              <p>Celebrities are often at the forefront of fashion, and\u000a  eyewear   is   no exception. From the red carpet to the street, stars\u000a  are   constantly   showing us how to make a statement with a pair of\u000a  glasses   or   sunglasses. Whether it''s Gigi Hadid''s trendy oversized\u000a  frames or   Johnny Depp''s quirky round glasses, there''s a celebrity\u000a  eyewear   inspiration for everyone. What''s more, these trends aren''t\u000a  just for   the rich and famous. With so many affordable and stylish\u000a  options   available, anyone can embrace their inner star and try out\u000a  these   looks. So, if you''re in the market for a new pair of glasses,\u000a  why not   take a cue from your favorite celebrities? You might just\u000a  find your   new favorite accessory.</p>\u000a              <p>Celebrities are often at the forefront of fashion, and\u000a  eyewear   is   no exception. From the red carpet to the street, stars\u000a  are   constantly   showing us how to make a statement with a pair of\u000a  glasses   or   sunglasses. Whether it''s Gigi Hadid''s trendy oversized\u000a  frames or   Johnny Depp''s quirky round glasses, there''s a celebrity\u000a  eyewear   inspiration for everyone. What''s more, these trends aren''t\u000a  just for   the rich and famous. With so many affordable and stylish\u000a  options   available, anyone can embrace their inner star and try out\u000a  these   looks. So, if you''re in the market for a new pair of glasses,\u000a  why not   take a cue from your favorite celebrities? You might just\u000a  find your   new favorite accessory.</p>','2024-05-01 14:13:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38125,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-04 22:12:58.643000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'0647513d-69fa-6559-5138-82ce2b90cf8d','0647513d-69fa-6559-5138-82ce2b90cf8d',38144,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:14:03.963000','2024-05-04 22:10:46.727000','Choosing the Right Frame Shape for Your Face: A Guide to Understanding Face Shapes','How to Choose Glasses Frames for Your Face Shape','choosing-the-right-frame-shape-for-your-face-a-guide-to-understanding-face-shapes-1',NULL,'<p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is an essential\u000a  aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame shape, you can\u000a  accentuate your features and enhance your overall appearance. It is\u000a  crucial to understand different face shapes and how they correspond to\u000a  different frame styles. This guide will walk you through the process\u000a  of identifying your face shape and pairing it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>\u000a              <h2>The right shape for you</h2>\u000a              <p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is\u000a  an   essential   aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame\u000a  shape,   you can   accentuate your features and enhance your overall\u000a  appearance. It is   crucial to understand different face shapes and\u000a  how they correspond to   different frame styles. This guide will walk\u000a  you through the process   of identifying your face shape and pairing\u000a  it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>\u000a              <p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is\u000a  an   essential   aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame\u000a  shape,   you can   accentuate your features and enhance your overall\u000a  appearance. It is   crucial to understand different face shapes and\u000a  how they correspond to   different frame styles. This guide will walk\u000a  you through the process   of identifying your face shape and pairing\u000a  it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>\u000a              <h2>Square, or round?</h2>\u000a              <p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is\u000a  an   essential   aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame\u000a  shape,   you can   accentuate your features and enhance your overall\u000a  appearance. It is   crucial to understand different face shapes and\u000a  how they correspond to   different frame styles. This guide will walk\u000a  you through the process   of identifying your face shape and pairing\u000a  it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>\u000a              <p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is\u000a  an   essential   aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame\u000a  shape,   you can   accentuate your features and enhance your overall\u000a  appearance. It is   crucial to understand different face shapes and\u000a  how they correspond to   different frame styles. This guide will walk\u000a  you through the process   of identifying your face shape and pairing\u000a  it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>\u000a              <p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is\u000a  an   essential   aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame\u000a  shape,   you can   accentuate your features and enhance your overall\u000a  appearance. It is   crucial to understand different face shapes and\u000a  how they correspond to   different frame styles. This guide will walk\u000a  you through the process   of identifying your face shape and pairing\u000a  it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>\u000a              <h2>Light or Dark?</h2>\u000a              <p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is\u000a  an   essential   aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame\u000a  shape,   you can   accentuate your features and enhance your overall\u000a  appearance. It is   crucial to understand different face shapes and\u000a  how they correspond to   different frame styles. This guide will walk\u000a  you through the process   of identifying your face shape and pairing\u000a  it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>\u000a              <p>Choosing the appropriate frame shape for your face is\u000a  an   essential   aspect of selecting eyewear. With the right frame\u000a  shape,   you can   accentuate your features and enhance your overall\u000a  appearance. It is   crucial to understand different face shapes and\u000a  how they correspond to   different frame styles. This guide will walk\u000a  you through the process   of identifying your face shape and pairing\u000a  it with the most flattering eyewear.</p>','2024-05-01 14:14:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38138,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-04 22:10:46.727000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'d43a3e7a-0025-94ca-07e9-07adc4417924','d43a3e7a-0025-94ca-07e9-07adc4417924',38157,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:14:18.992000','2024-05-04 22:18:26.885000','How to Identify Your Face Shape','Discover Your Face Shape to Find the Perfect Eyewear','how-to-identify-your-face-shape',NULL,'<p>Everyone''s face is unique, but they can be broadly categorized into\u000a  six basic shapes: oval, round, square, heart, diamond, and rectangle.\u000a  By examining your forehead, cheekbones, jawline, and face length, you\u000a  can determine your face shape. Once you have this information, you can\u000a  start exploring the world of eyewear and select the frames that\u000a  complement your face shape the most.</p>\u000a              <h2>The many difference faces, so to speak</h2>\u000a              <p>Everyone''s face is unique, but they can be broadly\u000a  categorized   into   six basic shapes: oval, round, square, heart,\u000a  diamond, and   rectangle.   By examining your forehead, cheekbones,\u000a  jawline, and face   length, you   can determine your face shape. Once\u000a  you have this   information, you can   start exploring the world of\u000a  eyewear and select   the frames that   complement your face shape the most.</p>\u000a              <p>Everyone''s face is unique, but they can be broadly\u000a  categorized   into   six basic shapes: oval, round, square, heart,\u000a  diamond, and   rectangle.   By examining your forehead, cheekbones,\u000a  jawline, and face   length, you   can determine your face shape. Once\u000a  you have this   information, you can   start exploring the world of\u000a  eyewear and select   the frames that   complement your face shape the most.</p>\u000a              <h2>Cheek bones</h2>\u000a              <p>Everyone''s face is unique, but they can be broadly\u000a  categorized   into   six basic shapes: oval, round, square, heart,\u000a  diamond, and   rectangle.   By examining your forehead, cheekbones,\u000a  jawline, and face   length, you   can determine your face shape. Once\u000a  you have this   information, you can   start exploring the world of\u000a  eyewear and select   the frames that   complement your face shape the most.</p>\u000a              <p>Everyone''s face is unique, but they can be broadly\u000a  categorized   into   six basic shapes: oval, round, square, heart,\u000a  diamond, and   rectangle.   By examining your forehead, cheekbones,\u000a  jawline, and face   length, you   can determine your face shape. Once\u000a  you have this   information, you can   start exploring the world of\u000a  eyewear and select   the frames that   complement your face shape the most.</p>\u000a              <h2>Shape of your eyes</h2>\u000a              <p>Everyone''s face is unique, but they can be broadly\u000a  categorized   into   six basic shapes: oval, round, square, heart,\u000a  diamond, and   rectangle.   By examining your forehead, cheekbones,\u000a  jawline, and face   length, you   can determine your face shape. Once\u000a  you have this   information, you can   start exploring the world of\u000a  eyewear and select   the frames that   complement your face shape the most.</p>\u000a              <h2>The size of your head (not your ego)</h2>\u000a              <p>Everyone''s face is unique, but they can be broadly\u000a  categorized   into   six basic shapes: oval, round, square, heart,\u000a  diamond, and   rectangle.   By examining your forehead, cheekbones,\u000a  jawline, and face   length, you   can determine your face shape. Once\u000a  you have this   information, you can   start exploring the world of\u000a  eyewear and select   the frames that   complement your face shape the most.</p>','2024-05-01 14:14:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38151,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-04 22:18:26.885000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'719c6bf7-dced-e23c-a48f-76a4b5a384b4','719c6bf7-dced-e23c-a48f-76a4b5a384b4',38170,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:14:30.273000','2024-05-04 22:21:16.142000','Matching Frame Shapes to Your Face','Pairing Your Face Shape with the Ideal Eyeglass Frame','matching-frame-shapes-to-your-face',NULL,'<p>Not all frames are suitable for every face shape. For instance, round\u000a  faces generally look best with rectangular or square frames, as they\u000a  help to make the face appear longer and slimmer. Alternatively, square\u000a  faces often benefit from round or oval eyeglasses that help soften the\u000a  angularity. Understanding these complementary relationships will help\u000a  you make informed choices.</p>\u000a              <p>Not all frames are suitable for every face shape. For\u000a  instance,   round faces generally look best with rectangular or square\u000a  frames, as   they help to make the face appear longer and slimmer.\u000a  Alternatively,   square faces often benefit from round or oval\u000a  eyeglasses that help   soften the angularity. Understanding these\u000a  complementary relationships   will help you make informed choices.</p>\u000a              <p>Not all frames are suitable for every face shape. For\u000a  instance,   round faces generally look best with rectangular or square\u000a  frames, as   they help to make the face appear longer and slimmer.\u000a  Alternatively,   square faces often benefit from round or oval\u000a  eyeglasses that help   soften the angularity. Understanding these\u000a  complementary relationships   will help you make informed choices.</p>\u000a              <p>Not all frames are suitable for every face shape. For\u000a  instance,   round faces generally look best with rectangular or square\u000a  frames, as   they help to make the face appear longer and slimmer.\u000a  Alternatively,   square faces often benefit from round or oval\u000a  eyeglasses that help   soften the angularity. Understanding these\u000a  complementary relationships   will help you make informed choices.\u00a0Not\u000a  all frames are suitable for   every face shape. For instance, round\u000a  faces generally look best with   rectangular or square frames, as they\u000a  help to make the face appear   longer and slimmer. Alternatively,\u000a  square faces often benefit from   round or oval eyeglasses that help\u000a  soften the angularity.   Understanding these complementary\u000a  relationships will help you make   informed choices.</p>\u000a              <p>Not all frames are suitable for every face shape. For\u000a  instance,   round faces generally look best with rectangular or square\u000a  frames, as   they help to make the face appear longer and slimmer.\u000a  Alternatively,   square faces often benefit from round or oval\u000a  eyeglasses that help   soften the angularity. Understanding these\u000a  complementary relationships   will help you make informed choices.\u00a0Not\u000a  all frames are suitable for   every face shape. For instance, round\u000a  faces generally look best with   rectangular or square frames, as they\u000a  help to make the face appear   longer and slimmer. Alternatively,\u000a  square faces often benefit from   round or oval eyeglasses that help\u000a  soften the angularity.   Understanding these complementary\u000a  relationships will help you make   informed choices.\u00a0Not all frames\u000a  are suitable for every face shape.   For instance, round faces\u000a  generally look best with rectangular or   square frames, as they help\u000a  to make the face appear longer and   slimmer. Alternatively, square\u000a  faces often benefit from round or oval   eyeglasses that help soften\u000a  the angularity. Understanding these   complementary relationships will\u000a  help you make informed choices.</p>\u000a              <p>Not all frames are suitable for every face shape. For\u000a  instance,   round faces generally look best with rectangular or square\u000a  frames, as   they help to make the face appear longer and slimmer.\u000a  Alternatively,   square faces often benefit from round or oval\u000a  eyeglasses that help   soften the angularity. Understanding these\u000a  complementary relationships   will help you make informed choices.</p>','2024-05-01 14:14:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38164,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-04 22:21:16.142000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'c0538e4b-e69f-371d-1849-3eb48efb0a35','c0538e4b-e69f-371d-1849-3eb48efb0a35',38183,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:14:43.717000','2024-05-04 22:13:50.129000','Experiment with Different Frame Styles','Don''t Be Afraid to Try Different Glasses Styles','experiment-with-different-frame-styles',NULL,'<p>While these guidelines are beneficial, they should not limit your\u000a  options. Each person is unique, and what works for one person may not\u000a  work for another. Therefore, have fun with your eyewear and try out a\u000a  variety of frame shapes and styles. You might discover a look that\u000a  defies conventional wisdom but looks fantastic on you.</p>\u000a              <p>While these guidelines are beneficial, they should not\u000a  limit   your   options. Each person is unique, and what works for one\u000a  person   may not   work for another. Therefore, have fun with your\u000a  eyewear and   try out a   variety of frame shapes and styles. You\u000a  might discover a   look that   defies conventional wisdom but looks\u000a  fantastic on you.</p>\u000a              <p>While these guidelines are beneficial, they should not\u000a  limit   your   options. Each person is unique, and what works for one\u000a  person   may not   work for another. Therefore, have fun with your\u000a  eyewear and   try out a   variety of frame shapes and styles. You\u000a  might discover a   look that   defies conventional wisdom but looks\u000a  fantastic on you.</p>\u000a              <p>While these guidelines are beneficial, they should not\u000a  limit   your   options. Each person is unique, and what works for one\u000a  person   may not   work for another. Therefore, have fun with your\u000a  eyewear and   try out a   variety of frame shapes and styles. You\u000a  might discover a   look that   defies conventional wisdom but looks\u000a  fantastic on you.</p>\u000a              <p>While these guidelines are beneficial, they should not\u000a  limit   your   options. Each person is unique, and what works for one\u000a  person   may not   work for another. Therefore, have fun with your\u000a  eyewear and   try out a   variety of frame shapes and styles. You\u000a  might discover a   look that   defies conventional wisdom but looks\u000a  fantastic on you.</p>\u000a              <p>While these guidelines are beneficial, they should not\u000a  limit   your   options. Each person is unique, and what works for one\u000a  person   may not   work for another. Therefore, have fun with your\u000a  eyewear and   try out a   variety of frame shapes and styles. You\u000a  might discover a   look that   defies conventional wisdom but looks\u000a  fantastic on you.</p>','2024-05-01 14:14:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38177,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-04 22:13:50.129000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(3,0,'2c9c7d0b-4383-3b6b-2976-89a84302fcb4','2c9c7d0b-4383-3b6b-2976-89a84302fcb4',38213,32106,16796623585306,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-01 14:25:50.360000','2024-05-31 17:59:23.592000','Comparing Polycarbonate and High-Index Lens Materials','Polycarbonate vs High-Index: Choosing the Right Lens Material','comparing-polycarbonate-and-high-index-lens-materials-1',NULL,'<p>When it comes to choosing thin and lightweight lenses, polycarbonate\u000a  and high-index materials are often considered. Polycarbonate lenses\u000a  are highly impact-resistant, making them ideal for children, athletes,\u000a  and individuals with active lifestyles. They also offer 100%\u000a  protection from the harmful UV rays. However, they are not as clear as\u000a  other lens materials and can cause slight distortions. High-index\u000a  lenses, on the other hand, are thinner and lighter than polycarbonate\u000a  lenses, even for high prescription powers. They offer better clarity\u000a  than polycarbonate lenses but are not as impact-resistant. Though they\u000a  can be more expensive, high-index lenses are an excellent choice for\u000a  people with strong prescriptions who want thin, lightweight glasses\u000a  without compromising the optical clarity. In conclusion, the choice\u000a  between polycarbonate and high-index lenses depends on your needs,\u000a  lifestyle, and prescription strength.</p>','2024-05-01 14:25:00.000000','1','0','',NULL,38207,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,20122,'Clarity Admin','2024-05-31 17:59:23.592000')
INSERT INTO BLOGSENTRY VALUES(1,0,'8802c098-1761-e526-8917-bf4152ca0391','8802c098-1761-e526-8917-bf4152ca0391',51824,32106,16796623585306,32252,'Walter Douglas','2024-08-29 17:47:57.359000','2024-08-29 17:47:58.391000','Things I Find Interesting in Eyewear',NULL,'things-i-find-interesting-in-eyewear',NULL,'Eyewear has always been more than just correcting my vision. It''s a way\u000ato express myself, a chance to play with different styles and colors.','2024-08-29 17:47:00.000000','1','1','',NULL,51830,NULL,'0',0,0,NULL,NULL,0,32252,'Walter Douglas','2024-08-29 17:47:58.391000')
